SUMMARY:Cassies - Album Release Konzert (Uhrzeit prüfen)
LOCATION:Flucc
DESCRIPTION:@WANNE | Cassies is an independent Indie-Rock band based in Vienna\, Austria. Founded in early 2024\, the release of their debut album "Somewhere Unexpected" set on October 30\, 2026\, marks a milestone in the bands history of collective commitment and outpour of creativity. "Somewhere Unexpected"\, recorded and mixed by Alex 'Fire' Tomann and mastered by Martin Scheer\, mirrors the everlasting process of breaking down and building yourself up again\, a shared experience amongst the five-piece band. The music combines alternative approaches with familiar song structures derived from Pop\, Psychedelic-Rock and Rap\, creating a musical expression that is both modern and tangible\, a natural bridge between the new and the familiar. With the release of the debut album and ending to the band's first summer tour\, culminating with the Release-Show of "Somewhere Unexpected" on the 29th of October\, Cassies is now embarking on a new journey of pushing their musical boundaries in the vast world of genre and sound\, while preparing for their next live shows\, which is where the collective passion of the band lies.  20:00 - 20:45 tba 21:15 - 22:30 Cassies  VVK: 22€ AK: 25€ 
URL:https://flucc.at/events/HmxHiT-cassies-album-release-konzert/
END:VEVENT
